WEBVTT

00:00:01.615 --> 00:00:13.493
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.627 --> 00:00:19.199
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:19.199 --> 00:00:26.105
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:37.642
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.851 --> 00:00:43.790
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:51.196
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:59.005
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:59.005 --> 00:01:05.879
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.879 --> 00:01:11.485
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.485 --> 00:01:17.724
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.724 --> 00:01:26.189
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:39.246 --> 00:01:41.915
He's a scientist from the Tanatulum
in the royal palace.

00:01:41.915 --> 00:01:45.009
This fellow told me the truth, Tina!

00:01:47.654 --> 00:01:51.391
Apparently, after the explosion,
you were on the brink of death,

00:01:51.391 --> 00:01:53.360
the doctors had given up on you,

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:58.131
and Titus appeared in the scientists'
room with you wrapped in a sheet.

00:01:58.131 --> 00:02:01.464
My brother, with a crazed look
in his eyes!

00:02:14.514 --> 00:02:16.683
You bastard! Gueroca!

00:02:16.683 --> 00:02:18.752
Little boy! You're just a coward

00:02:18.752 --> 00:02:21.243
whose precious princess was
stolen by a common soldier!

00:02:21.321 --> 00:02:23.016
What?!

00:02:29.095 --> 00:02:34.032
TRAGEDY

00:02:34.868 --> 00:02:39.005
However, that darling princess
is no more!

00:02:39.005 --> 00:02:40.905
Look!

00:02:44.811 --> 00:02:46.938
It appears to be starting.

00:02:48.281 --> 00:02:52.809
It's the light of Orsel!
Princess Tina has opened the Zone!

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.581
Tina!

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.502
Tina...

00:03:08.502 --> 00:03:10.993
What is? Tina!

00:03:14.241 --> 00:03:16.038
Tina...

00:03:29.656 --> 00:03:31.783
Hesma!

00:03:39.366 --> 00:03:41.001
Listen, Hesma...

00:03:41.001 --> 00:03:43.637
This is just a test.
It will be fine.

00:03:43.637 --> 00:03:46.606
As long as it can be controlled,
there's nothing to be afraid of!

00:03:46.606 --> 00:03:49.709
You're going to show me
her power as a weapon!

00:03:49.709 --> 00:03:55.011
My foolish older brother, turning his
beloved daughter into a weapon!

00:04:00.487 --> 00:04:02.011
Tina!

00:04:09.429 --> 00:04:12.232
What?! A palace guard was killed?!

00:04:12.232 --> 00:04:15.368
Last night, apparently someone
saw Lord Gueroca

00:04:15.368 --> 00:04:17.203
heading for the Tanatulum!

00:04:17.203 --> 00:04:18.138
It was him?!

00:04:18.138 --> 00:04:21.641
The king and Princess Tina should be
told to be extremely careful.

00:04:21.641 --> 00:04:25.345
Seth and the princess left
before daybreak,

00:04:25.345 --> 00:04:27.347
and they haven't returned yet.

00:04:27.347 --> 00:04:29.215
W-What did you say?!

00:04:29.215 --> 00:04:31.484
Something must have happened!

00:04:31.484 --> 00:04:34.681
Gueroca's behind this!
Go search his mansion!

00:04:41.194 --> 00:04:43.063
What is it, Aghi?

00:04:43.063 --> 00:04:45.398
Hesma is nowhere to be found.

00:04:45.398 --> 00:04:47.730
And the control panel
has been taken!

00:04:48.201 --> 00:04:51.227
Aghi! There's trouble!
Come right away!

00:04:55.508 --> 00:04:58.204
It's Orsel!
Orsel is coming from the Zone!

00:04:59.779 --> 00:05:02.373
It's being emitted at an
incredible rate!

00:05:02.582 --> 00:05:04.743
The Zone is open!

00:05:09.656 --> 00:05:12.420
What's happening?!

00:05:14.494 --> 00:05:16.296
It's Princess Tina.

00:05:16.296 --> 00:05:18.059
What's her location?!

00:05:24.337 --> 00:05:26.567
Gueroca! Where are you?!

00:05:27.107 --> 00:05:29.803
You bastard! Do you know
whose mansion this is?

00:05:33.213 --> 00:05:35.272
We're searching this mansion!
Move!

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:48.857
Tina!

00:05:56.169 --> 00:05:58.865
Seth! Tina!

00:06:12.419 --> 00:06:14.148
That's it!

00:06:29.669 --> 00:06:31.569
Tina...

00:06:39.079 --> 00:06:41.411
It's coming from the forest villa!

00:06:53.827 --> 00:06:55.428
What is that?!

00:06:55.428 --> 00:06:57.564
The Zone...

00:06:57.564 --> 00:07:00.692
She's drawing Orsel from it
at an incredible rate!

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.670
This is bad! I have to hurry
and get it under control!

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:04.738
Not yet!

00:07:04.738 --> 00:07:07.673
It's too soon! Don't panic!

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:48.875
Tina!

00:08:12.138 --> 00:08:14.174
What happened?!

00:08:14.174 --> 00:08:17.735
Look! I can see a ball of light
in the sky above the western region!

00:08:21.781 --> 00:08:23.983
Do you think Aghi and the others
are all right?!

00:08:23.983 --> 00:08:27.009
At any rate, all we can do is
wait to hear from them!

00:08:27.487 --> 00:08:29.648
Why did this happen?

00:08:37.697 --> 00:08:39.631
Tina...

00:08:43.236 --> 00:08:44.771
Amazing!

00:08:44.771 --> 00:08:47.874
This is Orsel's... Tina's power?!

00:08:47.874 --> 00:08:49.705
I can't cut it off!

00:08:50.877 --> 00:08:53.277
It isn't working!

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:58.177
I'm not getting a signal back
from Princess Tina!

00:08:58.585 --> 00:09:00.753
What does that mean?!

00:09:00.753 --> 00:09:02.722
The Zone can't be closed!

00:09:02.722 --> 00:09:05.384
What did you say?!

00:09:05.525 --> 00:09:07.093
Hesma!

00:09:07.093 --> 00:09:08.788
Aghi!

00:09:26.346 --> 00:09:28.007
Tina!

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:35.619
Tina!

00:09:38.191 --> 00:09:41.126
Tina! It's me! It's Seth!

00:09:45.632 --> 00:09:48.465
Tina!

00:09:55.775 --> 00:09:57.510
Tina!

00:09:57.510 --> 00:10:00.001
Stop it, Tina!

00:10:20.934 --> 00:10:22.799
Seth!

00:10:24.137 --> 00:10:26.172
We have to close the
Zone quickly!

00:10:26.172 --> 00:10:28.003
Can we do it from
the Tanatulum?

00:10:30.143 --> 00:10:32.008
All we can do is try!

00:10:35.748 --> 00:10:38.284
Is that Tina?

00:10:38.284 --> 00:10:42.021
Is the princess doing that?

00:10:42.021 --> 00:10:46.326
That's right! Please hurry.
It's dangerous here as well.

00:10:46.326 --> 00:10:51.331
Besides, in this confusion,
Lord Gueroca may start a revolt.

00:10:51.331 --> 00:10:55.165
That... is Tina?

00:10:55.201 --> 00:10:58.261
Sire! This is the result
of what you did!

00:10:58.438 --> 00:11:01.930
You turned the princess into
a thing like that!

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:06.269
My Tina...

00:11:14.754 --> 00:11:16.654
Tina...

00:11:18.925 --> 00:11:21.052
Seth!

00:11:22.662 --> 00:11:24.892
Tina!

00:11:26.766 --> 00:11:28.996
Tina! It's me!

00:11:30.837 --> 00:11:33.397
It's Seth! Tina!

00:11:36.309 --> 00:11:39.210
You have to snap out of it!
Snap out of it!

00:11:41.381 --> 00:11:44.550
Don't you know me?! Tina!

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.853
It's Seth! It's Seth, Tina!

00:11:46.853 --> 00:11:48.844
Tina!

00:12:15.481 --> 00:12:17.073
Tina...

00:12:18.017 --> 00:12:19.780
Seth!

00:12:21.888 --> 00:12:23.549
Seth!

00:12:23.589 --> 00:12:25.580
Seth!

00:12:38.805 --> 00:12:40.432
Tina!

00:13:25.051 --> 00:13:27.042
Tina...

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:32.458
Hurry up, Palza!

00:13:32.458 --> 00:13:33.493
I am!

00:13:33.493 --> 00:13:36.062
What's the frequency of Princess
Tina's operating mechanism?

00:13:36.062 --> 00:13:37.497
0.56!

00:13:37.497 --> 00:13:40.091
The Orsel is expanding
three times in size!

00:13:40.566 --> 00:13:43.592
I have a reading on the opening
the princess has made to the Zone!

00:13:44.504 --> 00:13:46.038
It's huge!

00:13:46.038 --> 00:13:47.740
It's enormous, Aghi!

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:52.044
It's dozens of times bigger than the
one we opened during our experiments!

00:13:52.044 --> 00:13:54.981
We have to hurry! Voltage 120!

00:13:54.981 --> 00:13:58.348
Okay! Sending the signal to
frequency 0.56!

00:13:58.918 --> 00:14:01.387
It's the same system
as the Out Zone!

00:14:01.387 --> 00:14:03.821
The Zone should close!

00:14:09.428 --> 00:14:10.830
There's no change!

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:12.923
It's just too big!

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:16.029
One more time!

00:14:30.249 --> 00:14:32.718
I-It won't close.

00:14:32.718 --> 00:14:35.152
We can't stop Princess Tina.

00:14:37.056 --> 00:14:38.491
What is this?

00:14:38.491 --> 00:14:42.393
It's Orsel! And it's...
it's pretty gigantic!

00:14:42.662 --> 00:14:44.096
What did you say?!

00:14:44.096 --> 00:14:45.498
It's not an instrument malfunction.

00:14:45.498 --> 00:14:47.533
Something has appeared in the west!

00:14:47.533 --> 00:14:49.797
It's heading for the princess!

00:14:50.736 --> 00:14:51.737
Where is it?!

00:14:51.737 --> 00:14:54.205
I can't... I can't see anything!

00:14:56.809 --> 00:15:00.074
Something... something is happening!

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:04.116
We don't understand anything
about the Zone!

00:15:04.116 --> 00:15:07.552
In a place that we can't see,
something is...

00:15:13.159 --> 00:15:14.751
Tina...

00:15:40.319 --> 00:15:42.048
Tina!

00:15:43.956 --> 00:15:45.391
Soran...

00:15:45.391 --> 00:15:47.827
What's the matter, Tina?!

00:15:47.827 --> 00:15:49.385
Tina!

00:15:52.999 --> 00:15:54.830
It's no use, Soran.

00:15:55.801 --> 00:15:59.605
Tina doesn't recognize
anyone's voice anymore.

00:15:59.605 --> 00:16:03.075
She's not our Tina anymore!

00:16:03.075 --> 00:16:05.066
Tina!

00:16:06.612 --> 00:16:09.248
Look out! Soran,
get out of there!

00:16:09.248 --> 00:16:12.615
What's the matter, Tina?!
You're lost, aren't you?!

00:16:28.267 --> 00:16:29.635
Look at that!

00:16:29.635 --> 00:16:31.569
Princess Tina's light is...

00:16:31.637 --> 00:16:33.939
The Orsel...

00:16:33.939 --> 00:16:36.430
It's been engulfed by
a black mist!

00:16:38.878 --> 00:16:40.675
Tina!

00:16:41.347 --> 00:16:43.482
Come on, Tina.

00:16:43.482 --> 00:16:46.042
Come with me back to
the palace.

00:16:51.824 --> 00:16:55.316
Let's go back to the
palace together, Tina.

00:17:19.185 --> 00:17:22.916
The boy... in the mask...

00:17:25.891 --> 00:17:27.085
Tina!

00:17:43.042 --> 00:17:44.509
Tina...

00:17:45.077 --> 00:17:46.977
Soran...

00:18:06.031 --> 00:18:08.434
Soran... I'm...

00:18:08.434 --> 00:18:12.165
I'm not a human being anymore.

00:18:12.972 --> 00:18:16.142
I know. I know, Tina.

00:18:16.142 --> 00:18:18.611
You don't have to say anything.

00:18:18.611 --> 00:18:22.515
It was something the scientists
did so we'll go to them.

00:18:22.515 --> 00:18:25.351
It's okay.
I'm here, right?

00:18:25.351 --> 00:18:28.053
No matter what happens,
I'll protect you, Tina.

00:18:28.053 --> 00:18:29.543
Soran...

00:18:29.622 --> 00:18:31.590
Soran...

00:19:05.257 --> 00:19:08.715
You couldn't hear my voice...

00:19:10.529 --> 00:19:14.329
But you could hear his voice?

00:22:01.533 --> 00:22:03.202
Tina...

00:22:03.202 --> 00:22:05.537
I have always protected you.

00:22:05.537 --> 00:22:09.974
Ever since we were little,
I have always protected you.

00:22:11.777 --> 00:22:13.379
My...

00:22:13.379 --> 00:22:15.210
Tina.

00:22:36.568 --> 00:22:46.170
At the bottom of a deep,
shimmering sea

00:22:46.645 --> 00:22:55.952
A tiny flower rests

00:22:56.555 --> 00:23:05.793
A sweet wind's even sweeter song
passes through a rainbow,

00:23:06.532 --> 00:23:15.574
And fish, rising from the bottom,
seem to flutter on the horizon.

00:23:15.574 --> 00:23:20.579
Everyone is singing love's melody,

00:23:20.579 --> 00:23:25.751
A warm light streams from the sky,

00:23:25.751 --> 00:23:30.856
And the sun's yellow gaze,
unbound and full,

00:23:30.856 --> 00:23:39.457
Is wrapped in the arms of the sea.
